5,0,1,talk,Servas,,Good morning. Let us begin this journey with open minds and hearts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I prefer the quiet, but I am here. Let us see what unfolds.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to meet you all. Let's have fun!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I observe carefully. Silence often speaks louder than words.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,May,,Hello! I'm May. I hope we can all get along nicely today.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,Wisdom comes from listening. Who feels most comfortable speaking first?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am content to listen. The story will reveal itself in time.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I think we should just chat and see who seems suspicious!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Suspicion is a tool, not a weapon. Use it wisely.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,May,,Agreed! Let's keep the vibes positive and friendly for now.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,A calm mind sees the truth. Do not rush to judgment.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,Indeed. Patience is a virtue in these dark times.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
