18,0,3,talk,Victoria,,Kindness can be a mask. I will watch your eyes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,May,,"Wow, Victoria, that's intense! I'm just here to make friends.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,The night is coming. May it bring clarity to all.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
